Thu Oct  1 01:43:57 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say ySaid 31 percent better damage. Reaper had higher hit/dam, but at that point it probably doesn't matter much
Thu Oct  1 01:44:54 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say I like the loop of leveling. Questing is quite a bit more tolerable with the bonuses
Thu Oct  1 01:45:28 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say I don't think 51-54 will be terrible, honestly. Debating on the fastest leveling classes up to the end
Thu Oct  1 01:46:25 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say With direction in the text file, and now the walk command I'll probably eek out Necro, Monk and Mage. C/C just seems like it would be a chore
Thu Oct  1 01:46:45 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say T/T is great, but the leveling at times was a bit much. Guarenteed dual hits helps, though
Thu Oct  1 01:48:52 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say I don't think the check happened with a bewitched weapon. I uncursed it at the healer intentionally now
Thu Oct  1 01:49:51 2026 :: Log Alaric [2401]: say Yeah, repair was broken the first couple days I was on. Wouldn't let you wear the gear (diploma for some reason) and when you repaired it wouldn't acknowledge the NPC, and would state that it was in perfect condition
